A||||14||Cliff Pennock||The future of this forum...
Z||000000||Cliff Pennock||08-20-99||03:29 PM||||Ok, I thought I'd let you all know what my plans are for this forum in the future.<p>Within a week or so the name will change from 212.206.1.44 to www.fiero.nl (that really needed to be done!). This also means I will set aside much more space on the server for FAQ's, technical publications, pictures, etc. I will also create space where you can post your pictures for this forum so there will be no need to post them on some free-webpage-server which is the cause for a lot of the "image viewing" problems here.<p>User profiles will change also - you will be able to add a picture of your Fiero and list all the mods you have done.<p>In short, www.fiero.nl will become an all-Fiero site! <IMG SRC="/ubb/smile.gif" WIDTH=15 HEIGHT=15><p>I have to remind you though, that I do this in my spare time and therefor it could take weeks, even months, before everything will be implemented! So far, this is my planning:<p>1) Create www.fiero.nl (almost done)<br>2) Create space for posting pictures<br>3) Create Fiero FAQ/articles webpages<br>4) Enhance user profiles<br>5) Update (upgrade) forum software<p>If you have any suggestions as what more I could add to this site, please let me know! Remember, ultimately this should become a site created for Fiero owners, <b>by</b> Fiero owners!
Z||000001||four50four||08-20-99||03:40 PM||||hey cliff, sounds like some great modifications to this site! as far as the name goes, it really wasn't that big of a deal since I (and probably everyone else) have this site bookmarked, but it will be easier to find and probably easier to get around. once again, thanks so much for making this great place for Fieros!
